    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry Fitzgerald Paul Reynolds are offering for sale a unique opportunity to acquire this detached bungalow, benefiting from two detached workshops/garages and occupying large site measuring 0.168 hec (0.41 acres) suitable for further development. (Subject to Planning Permission being obtained from Donegal County Council)\nThis detached bungalow offers excellent potential, occupying a substantial site with concrete yard and extensive space to the rear. Ideally located fronting onto the N56, the main Letterkenny to Kilmacrennan and beyond road, the property provides convenient access to Letterkenny and surrounding areas.\nThe bungalow extends to approximately 117 sq m and includes living room, kitchen/dining area, utility, 3 double bedrooms 1 of which is ensuite and family bathroom. There is also a large store room and side porch with access to rear and guest wc.\n\nThe property also benefits from two large garages, providing substantial storage, workshop or business-use potential.\nOccupying a prominent and highly convenient central location, the property benefits from an extensive site measuring 0.16 hec (0.41 acres), a substantial portion of which remains undeveloped, offering excellent potential for a range of residential or commercial development opportunities, subject to planning permission. \nA property with considerable potential for those seeking a family home with generous grounds, substantial garage space and future development possibilities"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 3.1 x 2.4\nLaminated timber flooring. Hot press. Coving\n\nLiving Room - 4.7 x 3.5\nLaminated timber flooring. Fireplace. Coving and centre ceiling rose.\n\nKitchen/Dining Area - 4.8 x 3.6\nTiled flooring. Eye and low level units with tiled splash back. Built in electric oven with four ring hob and overhead extractor fan. Integrated dishwasher.\n\nUtility Room - 1.7 x 1.4\nTiled flooring. Plumbed for washing machine/tumble dryer.\n\nSide Porch - 1.6 x 1.5\nTiled flooring. Door to rear of property\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.1 x 3.2\nLinoleum covering on floor.\n\nEnsuite - \nComprising w.c, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nBedroom 2 - 4.0 x 3.2\nCarpet covering on floor\n\nBedroom 3 - 4.1 x 3.1\nLaminated timber flooring.\n\nShower Room - 2.4 x 1.7\nTiled flooring and walls tiled floor to ceiling. Comprising w.c, wash hand basin and shower.\n\nWC - 1.6 x 1.5\nTiled flooring and walls tiled floor to ceiling. Comprising wc and wash hand basin.\n\nStore Room - 2.2 x 2.2\n\n\nGarage 1 - 10.0 x 6.0\n\n\nGarage 2 - 7.0 x 3.5\n\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Detached bungalow</li><li>Constructed 1965</li><li>Occupying 0.41 acre site with concrete yard to side and rear</li><li>Benefits from 2 large workshops/garages to rear </li><li>Landscaped lawns to front and side</li><li>Located within close proximity to Letterkenny Town centre</li><li>Frontage onto the N56</li><li>Total floor area 117 sq m</li><li>Comprising 3 no. bedrooms, 1 of which is ensuite.</li><li>Oil fired heating</li><li>Public water mains and public sewage disposal</li><li>Immense development potential</ul>"
      },
